etter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          CoE评分：87.21\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：柑橘，杏仁，苹果, 可可碎块，柔顺\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Citrus, Almond, Apple, Cacao nibs, Mild sweet\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCcTqPiaCB9OxiaaqAtrvrJAibq6RgZONK8Hdg7ntuMtEsJjribBkX065gEG4Wd4NWLQlBXM2w6LtV7Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Sitio Boa Vista 丽景庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在1950年代，OsvaldinaAlvesDutra和JoséDutraSobrinho继承了米纳斯矿\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          山的一小块土地，这里海拔1200米，高海拔不同地块的香气风味很丰富。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 米纳斯矿山是紫色、区块\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园主OsvaldinaDutra一直种植咖啡，经验丰富的她知道咖啡质量的重要性，以及种植和处理在整个生产过程中的根本作用。多年来，她一直在寻求提高咖啡品质的方法，并且在农场采用了先进的生产工艺。她的两个儿子埃德尼森（Ednilson）和沃尔特（Walter）也加入家族事业，他们都负责农场的运营管理。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia24a0rhvNnA9xYxdicWGKXjZJtYR4cjlpzcOWJs6ZkjE02RBb4HQEoraA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如今，咖啡产业全面可持续发展。营养充足土壤和优越的气候条件很有优势，会让咖啡的杯中风味，愉悦，干净，甜感高，巧克力和水果调。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2Pa1wvxicdeKFYRa1TZ5mH8CPeVOqwPJQoQtjFakdtxNzqdYCXjLeicmA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          参选COE竞赛的咖啡是一只精心培育的微批次。这只咖啡采收晚，果实成熟度高，在非洲晒床上干燥。整个干燥约15天。品质是生产的主要目标，从种植到仓储咖啡的整个过程都是可追溯的。该农场已通过雨林联盟认证。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，欢迎关注小程序或者淘宝店铺 “有容乃大”\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyF